# Module
Module510410Name = Vendor Product Images
Module510410Desc = Attach (or link) flagged product images when emailing vendor price requests and purchase orders

# Product Documents tab section
RfqImagesSection = Vendor email images
RfqImagesSend = Send images to vendors
RfqImagesSendHelp = When enabled, this product's selected files are attached to price request and purchase order emails (or sent as share links when too large).
RfqImagesFlaggedByCategory = (sent anyway: product is in category %s, selected in setup)
RfqImagesNotFlagged = This product is not flagged: none of these files are sent. Turn on "Send images to vendors" above, or select its category in the module setup.
RfqImagesInclude = Include
RfqImagesShareStatus = Public link
RfqImagesShared = Shared
RfqImagesPrivate = Private
RfqImagesRevoke = Revoke public link
RfqImagesShareRevoked = Public link removed for %s
RfqImagesNoFiles = No linked files of the file types chosen in the module setup.
RfqImagesOtherFiles = %s file(s) not sent because their extension is not in the setup list: %s

# Email form
RfqImagesAttached = %s product file(s) attached
RfqImagesLinked = %s product file(s) are too large to attach (total %s): share links will be added to the message when it is sent
RfqImagesSomeFailed = Some product files could not be added
RfqImagesLinksTitle = Product files:
RfqImagesExpire = Remove share links after
RfqImagesExpireDesc = Share links created by this module are removed this many days after the last email that included them (daily scheduled job). Links you shared by hand are never removed. 0 = keep links.
RfqImagesExpireCronOff = The Scheduled jobs module is off, so links will not be removed until it is enabled.
RfqImagesExpireShares = Remove expired product file share links
RfqImagesSectionDocuments = Documents
RfqImagesSectionFiles = Which files
RfqImagesSectionAttachments = Attachments
RfqImagesSectionLinks = Share links
RfqImagesSectionAdvanced = Advanced
RfqImagesLinksShowTitle = Heading above links
RfqImagesLinksShowTitleDesc = Show a line of text before the list of share links in the email
RfqImagesLinksTitleSetting = Heading text
RfqImagesLinksTitleSettingDesc = Text shown before the share links. Leave blank to use the default ("Product files:", translated to the email language).
RfqImagesLinksKeyDesc = Share links to the flagged product files (created when the email is sent)

# Setup
RfqImagesOnSupplierProposal = Price requests
RfqImagesOnSupplierProposalDesc = Add product files when emailing a price request
RfqImagesOnSupplierOrder = Purchase orders
RfqImagesOnSupplierOrderDesc = Add product files when emailing a purchase order
RfqImagesModuleOff = (module not enabled)
RfqImagesSetup = Vendor Product Images setup
RfqImagesSetupIntro = Flag products in the "Vendor email images" section of their Documents tab, or by category below. When a price request or purchase order is emailed, the files of flagged products are attached automatically.
RfqImagesExtensions = File extensions
RfqImagesExtensionsDesc = File types to send. Pick common ones from the list, or type any other extensions (e.g. sldprt, ai) in the second box. PDFs are not included by default.
RfqImagesExtensionsPick = Choose file types
RfqImagesExtensionsOtherPlaceholder = Other extensions, e.g. sldprt, ai
RfqImagesExtensionsEmpty = Choose at least one file type
RfqImagesExtGroupImages = image
RfqImagesExtGroupDocuments = document
RfqImagesExtGroupCad = CAD / 3D
RfqImagesExtGroupArchives = archive
RfqImagesCategories = Send for product categories
RfqImagesCategoriesPick = Choose categories
RfqImagesCategoriesDesc = Products in these categories (or their subcategories) are sent as if their own switch was on. Files unticked on a product's Documents tab are still left out.
RfqImagesCategoriesModuleOff = Enable the Categories module to use this.
RfqImagesNewFilesIncluded = Include new files
RfqImagesNewFilesIncludedDesc = On: files never ticked or unticked on a product's Documents tab are sent (so new uploads go out automatically). Off: they are left out until ticked. Files you already ticked or unticked keep your choice.
RfqImagesResize = Resize attached images
RfqImagesResizeDesc = Attach jpg, png and gif images shrunk to this many pixels on their longest side, so more emails stay under the size limit. Share links always point to the original. 0 = attach originals.
RfqImagesMaxAttach = Maximum total attachment size
RfqImagesMaxAttachDesc = Above this total, public share links are added to the message instead of attachments. 0 = always attach.
RfqImagesTemplateHelp = Put __RFQIMAGES_LINKS__ in a price request or purchase order email template (or type it in the message) to also include share links to the product files. The files are still attached; the links are created when the email is sent, so the files become reachable by link. Without the key, links are only used when the files are too large to attach.
RfqImagesRepairExtrafield = Recreate product extrafield
RfqImagesExtrafieldOk = Product extrafield is present
DebugMode = Debug Mode
DebugModeDesc = When enabled, exposes a diagnostic endpoint at /custom/rfqimages/ajax/debug.php (admins only).
